<title>FRANCE: Traders say block of UAP shares traded.</title>
<headline>Traders say block of UAP shares traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris share traders said a block of 250,000 shares in Union des Assurances de Paris (UAP) changed hands at 105.30 francs per share at 1450 GMT.</p>
<p>They said the block trade went through amid market talk of a public offer for UAP, with rival Axa SA being cited as the predator.</p>
<p>An Axa spokeswoman denied the rumour it was planning a bid for UAP.</p>
<p>UAP closed up 3.30 francs at 103.50.</p>
</text>
